Cell["\<\
This calculation is based on TDHF equation in density matrix form (von neumann)
Now find the stationary states of TDHF with Traces, solve TDHF equation = 0 \
ie deriv=0 so stationary state, solve for theta and phi\
\>", "Subtitle",
